      "snippet_id": "SNP-001",
      "snippet_text": "\"Active buyers totaled 86.5 million, down 3.4% year-over-year, and nearly flat sequentially, with modest sequential growth in U.S. buyers. During the quarter, Etsy acquired 6.8 million new buyers and reactivated 10.4 million buyers, representing 17.2 million gross buyer additions, a 2.7% increase from the prior year.\"",
